select public.admin_notify('🎯 D61: redirect URL ki zaroorat NAHI + webhooks LIVE verified', 'Owner thake hue: "new redirect url bharvaya hi nahi, bahut time waste". Seedha jawab diya: naya redirect URL zaroori NAHI — miniesports.local/cb registered+selected hai; redirect sirf Allow ke baad use hota hai (error page by-design, code address bar me); "App not active" error redirect se PEHLE aata hai, isliye naya URL usse theek nahi karega. Server probe se khushkhabri: app webhook subscription LIVE — object=instagram, callback=ig-dm-hub, active=true ⇒ configuration page ka section 3 green tick sach hai; sirf section 2 (grant/token) baaki. Ek hi procedure diya: (1) usi page par section 2 "Generate access tokens" expand karo → andar "Add Instagram account" button ho to tap → IG login zone_queen_55 → token generate+copy; (2) warna incognito me agent ka canonical Login URL (config_id + override_default_response_type, Meta docs ke anusar) kholo; (3) agar phir "App not active" aaye to dialog dubara mat try karo — PATH B: business.facebook.com portfolio Mini eSports → Settings→Accounts→Instagram Accounts→Add (dono accounts) → Users→System Users→Add ig-hub-bot (Admin) → assign assets dono IG → Generate new token (app Mini eSports, 6 permissions, Never) → copy. Token Drive private file me → "codes file ready".', 'session_end') as notified;
